Z||000000||1FST2M6||04-25-2000||01:35 PM||||I just bought a racing Kart that runs off of Methanol. I've been talking to the shops cyl.head guy he races a funny car running methanol. He said mixing 2 gallons of Methanol and 5 gallons of Premuim gas will net you about +/-30% Hp and Torque. with no ill-effects. on a stock engine (fuel injected only) anyone one else tried this? I'm seriously considering this... those are close to the same gains as Nitrous and actually a bit cheaper... unless the alcohol washs a cylinder wall and sieze up the motor... anyone?!?!?!||||reg||1
